    "body": "FYI, I'll add tests for this and https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9196:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/39647\r\n\r\nAbsent other input, I'm going to change Chromium to implement the \"loop\" approach. It seems reasonable, and does the right thing on this and https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9196.",
