    "updated_at": "2023-04-25T22:54:09Z",
    "body": "> However, I think the \"repeat the hide all popovers until\" approach [from above](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9197#issuecomment-1518697319) is **also** needed. Otherwise in the [example above](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9197#issuecomment-1521050260), we still hit the ASSERT that p16 is at the top of the stack. It finds p17 on top. We need to repeat the \"hide all\" so that p17 gets hidden and we can complete hiding p16.\r\n\r\nYeah, agreed, they are both needed to avoid this kind of issue.",
